        "objective": "Can state all days of the week in Arabic, explain their numerical etymology from roots 1 to 7 and the Sabbath/Gathering, recognize Gregorian and Hijri months, and use temporal prepositions (fī yawm al-Ahad, fī shahr Yanāyir).",
