        "level": "A1",
        "objective": "Conjugate Form I present-tense verbs in the plural (naḥnu naktubu, 'antum taktubūna, hum yaktubūna) with prefix na- and suffix -ūna, and recognize the dual forms (humā yaktubāni).",
