                    "reading": "Yūsuf Shāhīn fī Bāb al-Ḥadīd wa al-Maṣīr...",
                    "translation": "In \"Cairo Station\" and \"Destiny,\" Youssef Chahine fought extremism and defended intellectual freedom, crowned with the 50th Anniversary Prize at the Cannes Film Festival."
